Z||000000||Pyric||11-28-2001||08:52 AM||||I was considering replacing my stock cam with an upgraded one when I have the intake off next week.<P>Is a better Cam worth the trouble?  I was planning on getting the one from the Fiero store.  I didn't want a cam that would make it run rough, but I wanted one that was better.<P>Thanks,||||reg||5
Z||000001||1FST2M6||11-28-2001||09:06 AM||||you have to drop the cradle to pull the cam. it's not and incar thing. and not worth the $.  <A HREF="http://www.pawinc.com" TARGET=_blank>www.pawinc.com</A>  get their catalog or <A HREF="http://www.northernautoparts.com" TARGET=_blank>www.northernautoparts.com</A>  and get theirs.. their parts are cheaper than the FS for the SAME units, if your dead set on a cam swap. <P>well i guess i should have asked.. V6 or 4cyl? on a 6 the cradle needs to be droped.. on a 4 i don't know. <P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/1fst2m6sig_1.gif"> <P> <A HREF="http://www.1fst2m6.com" TARGET=_blank>www.1fst2m6.com</A>  - underconstruction - but check it out anywho...||||reg||1
Z||000002||Pyric||11-28-2001||09:32 AM||||It's a 6.  Last time I rebuilt it, it was out of the car, so I couldn't remember what all I had to do.  I just figured I'd do it with the intake out if I could, since I have to replace the gaskets anyway.<P>But if the increase isn't worth it, I'll keep the stock.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/rolleyes.gif"><P>Any ideas on other upgrades that WONT steal my torque?   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/confused.gif"> <BR>||||reg||1
Z||000003||FieroPerformance||11-28-2001||02:52 PM||||I just put that cam in my car. It runs good, I can't compare the difference because my engine had 128,000 miles on it and I replaced just about everything. It runs a lot stronger though.<P>-Charlie<P>It is the compucam 2030, also known as the powermax 2030. I got it for about $170 at a local speed shop. You can get it for that plus shipping at <A HREF="http://www.summitracing.com" TARGET=_blank>www.summitracing.com</A> <P>------------------<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/newsigfperformance.jpg"> ||||reg||1
Z||000004||Pyric||11-28-2001||03:31 PM||||Did it pass emissions?  (the summit racing page said that it was not legal for emission controlled vehicles).<P>Too bad I've got to pull the engine to install it.<p>[This message has been edited by Pyric (edited 11-28-2001).]||||reg||1
Z||000005||FieroPerformance||11-28-2001||10:02 PM||||Yeah it passed. I just went to E-Check yesterday. Didn't have any problem at all, it wasn't even close to failing. Plus I have my EGR valve plugged.<P>-Charlie||||reg||1
